flowchart LR
  GH[GitHub Actions OIDC] -->|ECR push + DescribeCluster| GHA[IAM CI role]
  GHA -->|Kubernetes group mlflowops:deployers| RBAC[Namespace Roles]
  K8S[EKS workloads] -->|Pod Identity| ESO[External Secrets role]
  ESO -->|Get only mlflowops/* + RDS master| SM[Secrets Manager]
  MF[MLflow service account] -->|Pod Identity, mlflow/ prefix only| S3[(Artifacts S3)]
  DR[Drift service account] -->|Pod Identity, drift-reports/ prefix| S3
  ROUTE[Serving HTTPRoute] --> GW[GatewayClass aws-alb / Gateway]
  GW -->|Reconciled by| ALB[AWS Load Balancer Controller]
  ALB -->|Pod Identity| ELB[Public ALB / Target Groups]
  EKS[EKS nodes] -->|TLS 5432| RDS[(Private RDS PostgreSQL)]
  CT[CloudTrail] -->|KMS + S3| AUDIT[(Audit S3)]
  GD[GuardDuty] --> CT
  ARGO[Argo CD] -->|GitOps sync| APP[Workload namespaces]
